15A的达锂保护板以确保安全，整个装置支持Type-C充电，便于日常维护。外壳+风嘴都是在拓竹平台找的，在此感谢作者。ChatGPT 生成的海报有点问题，将就看吧哈哈 &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E5%B0%8F%E9%A3%8E%E6%89%87?type=0&quot;&gt;#小风扇#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/DIY?type=0&quot;&gt;#DIY#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/f8c98100b08dd53b77ca740244944a9d.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/c8a4a2d0abc9f291e27cc7b1cdd849e2.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/95afebba7a7bc94a4bee66f5ec28a1e0.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/9e6afdd8822d00f76620d5ecdcf1a659.gif&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/a9a74626624c7a62b8ebe9d0f36835ee.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/6224a4160f86824134f5a2c6ffdcdd3c.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/397a76587ded563dcd91bff9f98538ae.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/adf3082a51ab24874fee066f4b7ef0e9.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/bce10c7d1f0a16954e84b7ec9c3ff0c3.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72608939</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72608939</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 14:33:18 GMT</pubDate><author>剑漁</author></item><item><title>#DIY# 正点原子好价，百亿补贴积分兑换，141</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/DIY?type=0&quot;&gt;#DIY#&lt;/a&gt; 正点原子好价，百亿补贴积分兑换，141&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/2076c9305055d3e557fe2e966b48b516.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72569116</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72569116</guid><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:56:37 GMT</pubDate><author>云畅通无阻</author></item><item><title>分享一个解压手办——异世界归来的舅舅DoCoMo so505i